                        "form": "wenises"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c9cca5f5-a20d-3f73-9f4c-9d9ef6477ac8",
                        "entry_id": "e0fac65c-23e8-3d05-93fa-a320baedeece",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The skin on the outside of the elbow."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b64f3d8-978f-42c1-8bda-21f6ab149404",
                                "sense_id": "c9cca5f5-a20d-3f73-9f4c-9d9ef6477ac8",
                                "text": "“Did you know your wenis is showing?” “My what?” “Your wenis!” How hilarious. This joke — which I didn't get — was on me. “You got punk'd, girlfriend!” squealed Caitlin when I told her. Kitch had heard that one before. “Wenis is the medical term for the flabby skin on the elbow,” he said. I stood in front of the mirror, fingering my wenis. Flabby, was it?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13b009bb-e7e2-48bf-8ae9-57e70b7df55b",
                                "sense_id": "c9cca5f5-a20d-3f73-9f4c-9d9ef6477ac8",
                                "text": "“[…] Or know that this”—he tickled her elbow—“is the sexiest wenis I've ever seen.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f22a290-b508-473e-a77b-e805f0eb8c33",
                                "sense_id": "c9cca5f5-a20d-3f73-9f4c-9d9ef6477ac8",
                                "text": "I learned to appreciate skin where skin didn't matter before. Like the wenis of an elbow."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b435933d-f924-37d7-a5c8-0ec925e819c1",
                        "entry_id": "e0fac65c-23e8-3d05-93fa-a320baedeece",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The penis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e835e17b-eb9a-4c03-a00f-3e74ac2d67a0",
                                "sense_id": "b435933d-f924-37d7-a5c8-0ec925e819c1",
                                "text": "“At least I win the biggest wenis contest.” You think your wenis beats my salami?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f7794a5-c2c4-4948-84de-4a9618484c56",
                                "sense_id": "b435933d-f924-37d7-a5c8-0ec925e819c1",
                                "text": "Actually i thnk he's been exposing his wenis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "60329be0-2fef-42b0-8c83-7e96fa425a0a",
                                "sense_id": "b435933d-f924-37d7-a5c8-0ec925e819c1",
                                "text": "“Hey, Phil, look.” [Alan laughing] “He's jacking his little weenis.” “Pull yourself together, man.” “Not at the table, Carlos.” [Alan & Phill laughing]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "829cfecc-e4a7-4e84-ad67-4fb9f68278c4",
                                "sense_id": "b435933d-f924-37d7-a5c8-0ec925e819c1",
                                "text": "“Don't be such a wenis,” she says. “He bites me like five times a week.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
